    biomarkers: ["Mitotic count and necrosis (WHO typical versus atypical)", "Ki-67 index (supportive, not definitional in the lung)", "Somatostatin receptor PET (staging and somatostatin analogue or radioligand eligibility)", "Chromogranin A (monitoring)", "ACTH and cortisol where Cushing's syndrome is suspected", "Germline MEN1 in young or multiple tumours"],
